HARD NEGATIVE
SOURCE DIVERSITY CANNOT REMOVE A FAILURE MODE SHARED BY ALL SOURCES.

If every measurement channel carries the same artifact,
cross-source agreement only makes the artifact look more credible.

Thus:

CONSENSUS CANNOT MANUFACTURE INDEPENDENCE

also applies to structural heredity.

